    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553">

                <pb facs="0481" n="475" xml:id="pg475"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.5151/155: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dooman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-08-19T19:00:00+09:00">August 19, 1939—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 19—8:18 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>418. Our 404, August 12, 2 p.m.<anchor n="33" xml:id="d553-f1"/> Foreign Office
                    advised us informally today that Ministry of Finance will hereafter issue
                    permits regularly with a time lag of 2 months: permit for June remittance to be
                    issued in September, July remittance in October and so on. Foreign Office added
                    that this will be communicated to us formally by note early next week.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dooman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
